%% GET /graphql?extensions={"persistedQuery":{"sha256Hash":...}}
flowchart LR
  C[GET /graphql?hash · persisted query] --> CSRF{Preflight header?}
  CSRF -->|no| E400[400 blocked · CSRF prevention]
  CSRF -->|yes| APQ{Hash known?}
  APQ -->|no| NF[Not found · PERSISTED_QUERY_NOT_FOUND]
  NF --> REG[Client sends POST once · query + hash]
  REG --> STORE[Apollo saves it · hash to query]
  APQ -->|yes| RUN[Run the query · same steps as POST]
  RUN --> OK[200 · Cache-Control public]
  OK --> CDN[CDN caches it · fixed URL like REST]
